# Population scale probe (reports/engine/2026-11-26-npc-scale/README.md): the world simulates
# N peaceful civilians with their native routines while the hero stands alone in the valley,
# nobody near. The day journal is not used: its per-tick poll would dominate the frame.
# @headless
# @timeout 5400
# Ladder variants replace the count and the game-time window: 10k/10 min, 100k/5 min, 1M/2 min.
seed 73106
cheat god
world-check NEWWORLD.ZEN
goto NW_XARDAS_TOWER_VALLEY_091
npcscale stats start
npcscale 10000
wait 600000
npcscale stats end
